<title>USA: Triden Telecom to spin-off unit.</title>
<headline>Triden Telecom to spin-off unit.</headline>
<dateline>TYLER, Texas 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triden Telecom Inc said it will spin-off the remaining 80 percent its wholly-owned unit, Angell Communications Inc, to shareholders of record November 11.</p>
<p>Triden spun off 20% of Angell effective August 25, 1996 and has decided to distribute the balance of its interest, as a dividend, to shareholders on the record date.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
